{"lane":"L4","findings":[{"id":"L4-1","surface":"D1","severity":"P2","fix_class":"judgment","file":".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/feature-catalog/convergence/anti-convergence-floor.md","line":25,"issue":"The doc says the template defines `antiConvergence.minIterations` and 'The workflow writes those values into the config record'. That implies the run's floor lives at `antiConvergence.minIterations`. In fact `step_create_config` in deep-research.yaml writes the floor as a top-level `minIterations: 3` (line 723), and `stopDecisionConfig` in convergence.cjs (lines 1398-1400) reads `config.minIterations` before `antiConvergence.minIterations`. So editing `antiConvergence.minIterations` in a created config does not change the floor while the top-level key is present. The doc should name the top-level `minIterations` key the workflow writes and say that it takes precedence.","evidence":{"cmd":"rg -n \"^          minIterations: 3|antiConvergence.minIterations\" .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research.yaml","exit":0,"out":"723:          minIterations: 3"}}],"reviewed":[".skilled/commands/deep/research.md",".skilled/commands/deep/review.md",".skilled/skills/sk-design/sk-design-md-generator/styles/library/bundles/70materia/DESIGN.md",".skilled/skills/sk-design/sk-design-md-generator/styles/library/bundles/anacuna/DESIGN.md",".skilled/skills/sk-design/sk-design-md-generator/styles/library/bundles/base44/DESIGN.md",".skilled/skills/sk-design/sk-design-md-generator/styles/library/bundles/elementor/DESIGN.md",".skilled/skills/sk-design/sk-design-md-generator/styles/library/bundles/flatfile/DESIGN.md",".skilled/skills/sk-design/sk-design-md-generator/styles/library/bundles/speakeasy/DESIGN.md",".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/assets/deep-research-strategy.md",".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/feature-catalog/convergence/anti-convergence-floor.md",".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/feature-catalog/convergence/divergent-convergence-mode.md",".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/feature-catalog/convergence/expansive-depth-mode.md",".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/feature-catalog/feature-catalog.md",".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/feature-catalog/loop-lifecycle/completed-run-extension.md",".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/feature-catalog/loop-lifecycle/initialization.md",".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/manual-testing-playbook/convergence-and-recovery/anti-convergence-floor.md",".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/manual-testing-playbook/convergence-and-recovery/frontier-open-veto-holds-soft-stop.md"]}
